     ---
     id: R1615000
     title: Charge and Indestructible leave the combat keyword pool (issue #1615)
     cards: "§6.1, R21, R347, R781004, R781005, R1025000, Core #63, Core #80, Classic+ #15, Classic+ #16, Classic+ #17, Meditative #65"
